  "decision_conditions": [
    "Prior to the commencement of the development (excluding demolition works), full\rdetails of the secure cycle storage facilities shall be submitted to, and approved in writing\rby, the Local Planning Authority which shall show their positioning within the site, the size\rand materials of the enclosure and the means of access. The approved details shall be\rimplemented on site prior to the first occupation of the development hereby approved and\rthereafter permanently retained in accordance with the approved details.\r\rReason: To ensure the development provides an adequate level of cycle parking facilities\rand to encourage sustainable modes of transport, in accordance with policies 36 and 37\rof the Sutton Local Plan 2018.",
    "Prior to the first occupation of each individual commercial unit, a detailed Waste and\rRefuse Management Strategy specific to that unit shall be submitted to and approved in\rwriting by the Local Planning Authority. The approved Strategy shall be implemented and\radhered to for the lifetime of the respective unit's use.\r\rReason: To ensure adequate provision is made for the storage and removal of waste and\rto protect amenity in accordance with policy 28 of the Sutton Local Plan 2018."
